-story\">As of Oct 12, Refugio County has a record of 75 years on its 8 grids, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids, September to October came in under 90% of normal in 41 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025, the middle saw October to November at 38% of normal and September to October at 48%. So far in 2026, the middle ran January to February at 16% and May to June at 254%.</p>"}
